  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "910055ee-0bee-7aef-1ce4-c67ee3c1d9d9",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "36ef7ddb-2907-648d-f139-cb33821d9013",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Located in various health hotspots in Karachi,  the health camps provided information about basic hygiene and protection from infectious diseases such as malaria, dengue and pneumonia.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Serving as a reminder of the University's emphasis on community services, the visitors were also offered free screenings for blood pressure, weight, BMI, blood glucose level and anaemia. A mental health counsellor was also present to screen people for depression and offer advice on stress management.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In the new Sabzi Mandi area, cases of tuberculosis, skin infections, worm infestations, diarrhoea and anaemia were found. Alumni also referred patients with serious condition to the nearest health centres.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
